# 💸 Paisa Tracker

### Know where every rupee goes.

A fast, good-looking **Income & Expense Calculator** built with plain HTML, CSS and JavaScript[cite: 8].  
No frameworks. No backend. Your data stays in **your** browser[cite: 8].

[**🚀 Live Demo**](https://paisa-todo-app.netlify.app) &nbsp;•&nbsp; [**📂 Source Code**](https://github.com/kowsalyadevivijay-cloud/Todo-app)[cite: 8, 9]

