## ✨ What can it do?

### The essentials
| | Feature |
|---|---|
| ➕ | **Create** income and expense entries (amount, description, category, date & time) |
| 👀 | **Read** all entries in a live-updating list |
| ✏️ | **Update** any entry with the edit button |
| 🗑️ | **Delete** any entry with the delete button |
| 📊 | **Totals at the top**: total income, total expenses and net balance |
| 🔘 | **Radio filters**: `All` / `Income` / `Expense` |
| ♻️ | **Reset button** in the form clears the input fields |
| 💾 | **localStorage**: your data is still there after closing the browser |
| 📱 | **Responsive**: works on desktop, tablet and mobile |

### Bonus extras
- 🌙 Dark mode
- 🎯 Monthly budget with a progress bar and "runway" card
- 📈 Yearly bar chart (income vs expense) and a category donut chart
- 🔍 Search across descriptions and categories
- 🗓️ Time filter for the totals: All time, Today, Last 7 days, This month, This year
- 📤 Export to CSV and JSON backup, 📥 import from `.xlsx`, `.csv` or `.json`
- ✨ Smooth animations and a custom cursor effect on desktop
- ₹ Indian rupee formatting (e.g. ₹1,25,000)

---

## ⌨️ Keyboard shortcuts

| Key | Action |
|---|---|
| `N` | Open the new transaction form |
| `/` | Jump to the search box |
| `Esc` | Close the form, the menu or the dialog |

---

## 🛠️ Tech stack

- **HTML5** for the page structure
- **CSS3** for the design, theming and responsive layout (Flexbox and Grid)
- **JavaScript (ES6)** for the logic, with no frameworks
- **localStorage** for saving data in the browser
- **SheetJS** (only for Excel import and export)

---

## 📁 Project structure

```text
Todo-app/
├── index.html   → page structure
├── style.css    → styling, dark mode, responsive layout
├── script.js    → CRUD, filters, charts, localStorage
└── Readme       → you are here
```[cite: 2, 8]

---

## ▶️ Run it locally

1. Download or clone the project

   ```bash
   git clone [https://github.com/kowsalyadevivijay-cloud/Todo-app.git](https://github.com/kowsalyadevivijay-cloud/Todo-app.git)
   ```[cite: 8]

2. Open the folder and double-click `index.html`

That's it. There is nothing to install and no build step.

---

## 🧭 How to use it

1. Click **+ New Transaction** (or press `N`).
2. Pick **Expense** or **Income**, then fill in the amount, description, category and date.
3. Hit **Save**. The totals, charts and list update straight away.
4. Use the **radio filters** to see only income or only expenses.
5. Click ✏️ to edit an entry or 🗑️ to delete it.
6. Made a mistake in the form? Press **Reset** to clear the fields.
7. Want a fresh start? **Delete all** in the sidebar wipes everything (it asks first).

